WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.096
Tom and Cat followed the footprints and hoofprints.

2
00:00:19.097 --> 00:00:32.062
The prints went deep into the Dark Forest.

3
00:00:32.063 --> 00:00:35.602
"It's spooky here," Tom said.

4
00:00:35.603 --> 00:00:38.208
"Where is the unicorn?"

5
00:00:38.209 --> 00:00:44.324
"Shh," Cat said. "I hear voices."

6
00:00:44.325 --> 00:00:46.460
Tom listened.

7
00:00:46.461 --> 00:00:49.874
"I'm having fun," Princess Mary said.

8
00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:53.293
"Me too," another voice said.

9
00:00:53.294 --> 00:00:56.526
"It's nice to have a friend."

10
00:00:56.527 --> 00:00:59.837
"That's the unicorn!" Cat whispered.

11
00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:04.910
Tom and Cat hurried into a clearing.

12
00:01:04.911 --> 00:01:09.735
Princess Mary was talking to a white unicorn.

13
00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:14.516
"What are you doing here, Tom?" Princess Mary asked.

14
00:01:14.517 --> 00:01:19.322
"No one invited you!" the unicorn said.

15
00:01:19.323 --> 00:01:23.218
"Everyone is worried about you, Princess," Tom said.

16
00:01:23.219 --> 00:01:25.841
"You must come back to the castle."

17
00:01:25.842 --> 00:01:29.248
"I went for a walk," Princess Mary said.

18
00:01:29.249 --> 00:01:32.402
"And I met this unicorn."

19
00:01:32.403 --> 00:01:37.070
"You can't go back to the castle!" the unicorn said.

20
00:01:37.071 --> 00:01:43.243
"I am very lonely.

21
00:01:43.244 --> 00:01:46.345
An ugly ogre lives nearby.

22
00:01:46.346 --> 00:01:49.402
But he only wants to fight."

23
00:01:49.403 --> 00:01:51.634
Tom gulped.

24
00:01:51.635 --> 00:01:55.707
"Ogre?" he thought.

25
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:59.154
Princess Mary looked at the unicorn.

26
00:01:59.155 --> 00:02:02.806
"I'll tell everyone I'm safe," she said.

27
00:02:02.807 --> 00:02:05.667
"Then I'll come back to visit you."

28
00:02:05.668 --> 00:02:08.829
The unicorn stamped her hoof.

29
00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:12.870
"You will forget about me," she said.

30
00:02:12.871 --> 00:02:17.611
"I won't let you go!"

31
00:02:17.612 --> 00:02:21.306
"You can't keep the princess here!" Tom cried.

32
00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:24.935
The unicorn snorted.

33
00:02:24.936 --> 00:02:31.460
"Try to stop me!"
